 Changes through 1.9.9e did not credit all contributions;
 it is not possible to add this information.
 
+20261031
+	+ improve configure check for wcwidth, for msys2 port.
+	+ modify configure check for multiuser systems to use getent if it is
+	  available.
+	+ remove obsolete configure macro CF_LDFLAGS_STATIC (prompted by
+	  discussion with Julian Waters).
+	+ modify convert_strings to disallow overlapping strings.
+	+ add null-pointer checks for terminfo/termcap function parameters.
+	+ pad str_table with a '\0' in case of malformed terminfo data which
+	  omits a '\0' on the final string (report/testcase by Can Ozkan).
+
 20261024
 	+ modify initialization for term-driver return terminfo data when given
 	  a name in $TERM unless _nc_console_vt_supported() returns true, as in
